# Donut Tycoon ships as a single-page app (`web.output: "static"` in app.json),
# so there is exactly one HTML document and Expo Router resolves the rest on the
# client. Without this rule a hard refresh on a deep route would 404 on
# Cloudflare Pages.
#
# 200 rather than 301: the URL must stay put so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
